												"$ref": "AAAAAAGL8m/TSDABZTo="
											},
											"name": "values",
											"documentation": "Returns an iterable collection of the values contained in the map.\nNote that the same value will be given multiple times in the result\nif it is associated with multiple keys.\n@return iterable collection of the map's values",
											"visibility": "package",
